{"id":"ac19962b23d6ff8a","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-friedberg-set-splitting.md","title":"Friedberg 的集合分裂形式","display":"thm-friedberg-set-splitting — Friedberg 的集合分裂形式","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-friedberg-set-splitting","aliases":["20-thm-friedberg-set-splitting"],"display":"thm-friedberg-set-splitting — Friedberg 的集合分裂形式","chapter":"2","section":"2.7","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.7.1；由 Exercise 2.7.2 的强版推出","source_pdf_pages":[85,86],"source_printed_pages":[49,50],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting]]","[[20-thm-rec-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-friedberg-set-splitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-friedberg-set-splitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-friedberg-set-splitting — Friedberg 的集合分裂形式"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.7.1；由 Exercise 2.7.2 的强版推出"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>85</span><span>86</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>49</span><span>50</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d84487411a19c7f3\" href=\"?note=d84487411a19c7f3\" title=\"20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting\">20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\">\\(B\\in\\mathcal E\\setminus\\mathcal R\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d84487411a19c7f3\" href=\"?note=d84487411a19c7f3\" title=\"20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting\">20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}friedberg\\text{-}set\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\exists A_0,A_1\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\cup A_1=B\\land\nA_0,A_1\\notin\\mathcal R].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}friedberg\\text{-}set\\text{-}splitting}\\vdash\n\\exists A_0,A_1\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\cup A_1=B\\land\nA_0,A_1\\notin\\mathcal R].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>直接应用本目录新增的强动态分裂，再取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\omega\">\\(W=\\omega\\)</span>。非计算 c.e. B 的补集非 c.e.，所以每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\setminus A_i\">\\(\\omega\\setminus A_i\\)</span> 非 c.e.；由于 A_i 为 c.e.，互补定理给两边均非计算。证明来自本书第 2.7 节的动态机制，已不绕用第 7.5 节 Sacks 分裂。强差集保持及统一索引算法见直接上游。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.7.1；由 Exercise 2.7.2 的强版推出；印刷页 49, 50；PDF 第 85, 86 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"d84487411a19c7f3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rec-re","status":"resolved","id":"550ce05cba351a42","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-rec-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting","status":"resolved","id":"d84487411a19c7f3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-rec-re","status":"resolved","